-- Install script of module 'sales': its part of the schema as it was in production at
-- supabase/baseline/VERSION. Applied after the core baseline (scripts/db/build-fresh.sh).
-- Objects owned by this module: supabase/modules/sales/objects.json. Safe to re-run.

